  "note": "Compare after normalizing U+202F and U+00A0 to plain space (CLDR 42 AM/PM spacing varies by ICU version). Known CLDR/engine divergence: en-GB foreign currency symbols (US$ vs $), narrow relative abbreviations/punctuation, zero relative now wording, and non-English locale data; these are structural cases, not verified Android/iOS overrides. Relative thresholds in milliseconds: second=1000, minute=60000, hour=3600000, day=86400000, month=2592000000 (30 days), year=31536000000 (365 days); choose the largest threshold <= abs(diff), truncate toward zero; abs(diff)<1000 uses localized now. No weeks or calendar arithmetic. engines overrides are reserved for measured platform differences.",
